// Service Calendar as a dashboard page (Kate, 17 Nov 2026: "pati service calendar ehhh ndi pa nakalagay sa loob mismo nung dashboard").
// The page is the Team Home one (hub/servicecal.html), which stays as the door for Reception and Call Centre because they are not on the dashboard list.
// Here it is the same code drawn into a shadow root inside view-servicecal, so its styles and ids cannot clash with the dashboard's, under the dashboard's
// main sidebar and fixed top bar; its own filter bar (Branch, Period, View) sticks under that bar. Reads service_calendar() and client_book_card()
// (migrations/service_calendar.sql), which decide who may read. Needs from dashboard.js: sb. Generated by a one-off copy on 17 Nov 2026, so later
// changes to the Team Home page are made in both files.

